 {"sec": "Neuroblastoma work-up and management · p223–224", "page": 224, "q": "N-myc gene amplification in neuroblastoma indicates —", "opts": ["Good prognosis", "Stage 4S behaviour", "High risk", "Low risk"], "ans": 2, "exp": "High-risk genetics: hypodiploidy, N-myc amplification, loss of heterozygosity (1p, 11q). (Book p224)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C48-058"},
