 {"sec": "Wilms tumour staging and treatment · p225", "page": 225, "q": "Match the COG stage of Wilms tumour with its surgical/oncological plan:", "opts": ["A-2, B-1, C-4, D-3", "A-2, B-1, C-3, D-4", "A-3, B-1, C-4, D-2", "A-3, B-4, C-2, D-1"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Correct pairs: Stage 1/2→Radical nephrectomy + vincristine and actinomycin D for 18 weeks; Stage 3/4→Radical nephrectomy + vincristine, actinomycin D and doxorubicin for 24 weeks with radiotherapy; Stage 5→Partial nephrectomy + surgery, chemotherapy and radiotherapy; Stage 4 with lung metastasis→Systemic therapy for hematogenous spread to lung and liver. (Book p225)", "type": "match", "pairs": [["Stage 1/2", "Radical nephrectomy + vincristine, actinomycin D and doxorubicin for 24 weeks with radiotherapy"], ["Stage 3/4", "Systemic therapy for hematogenous spread to lung and liver"], ["Stage 5", "Radical nephrectomy + vincristine and actinomycin D for 18 weeks"], ["Stage 4 with lung metastasis", "Partial nephrectomy + surgery, chemotherapy and radiotherapy"]], "id": "PEDS-C48-109"},
